                    <h3 class="font-bold text-sm text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2">
                        <i data-lucide="shield-alert" class="w-5 h-5 text-rose-600"></i>
                        Live Proctoring Security Violations & Integrity Audit Log
                    </h3>
                    <span class="text-xs bg-rose-100 text-rose-800 px-3 py-1 rounded-full font-bold">3 Incidents Flagged</span>
                </div>
                <div class="overflow-x-auto border border-slate-200 rounded-xl">
                    <table class="w-full text-xs text-left">
